  "href": "https://github.com/dk3yyyy?tab=repositories",
  "body": "Python is Joshua’s primary backend language across his owned repositories. Verified direct use includes FastAPI services, asyncio/aiohttp and httpx for asynchronous and external API work; SQLAlchemy with PostgreSQL, Redis and SQLite/aiosqlite for persistence, caching and durable bot state; Docker and n8n for self-hosted workflow orchestration; and Telegram bot APIs. His local retrieval project uses ChromaDB, Ollama and LangChain integrations. Noughtline adds a Node.js/Express service, Socket.IO realtime transport, JWT authentication, rate limiting and SQLite. The portfolio assistant uses Cloudflare Pages Functions and Workers AI. React, Vite, Streamlit UI and Playwright are present in projects but are not classified as backend technologies.",
